  "limitations": [
    "Single-object surgical reconstruction from the pinned merged archive, not a full 47-toolkit OCCT rebuild.",
    "The base archive remains the upstream artifact pin; the derived slice intentionally differs from that pin and is identified by its receipt and the tracked expectedResult.",
